    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14822" root="رجب" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْجَابٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْعَآء</span> [i. e. <i>bowels,</i> or <i>intestines, into
which the food passes from the stomach</i>]: (As, S,
K:) it has no pl. (S, K) known to A'Obeyd:
(S:) or its sing. is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجَبٌ</span></b> , (Kr, K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُجْبٌ</span></b> ,
(K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِجْبٌ</span></b> . (Ibn-Hamdaweyh.)

